OL,3,AParalympian charged with 11 counts of
OL,4,Arape
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn athlete who won a silver medal for
OL,7,FBritain at the 2024 Paralympics in
OL,8,FParis has been charged with 11 counts
OL,9,Fof rape.
OL,11,FWheelchair basketball player Lee Fryer,
OL,12,F26, from Pontefract, West Yorkshire,
OL,13,Ffaces 17 charges in total, including
OL,14,Fvoyeurism, intentional strangulation,
OL,15,Fassault and possession of a class A
OL,16,Fdrug, namely cocaine.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
